('<h4>Niente memoria condivisa</h4><p>I teammate non vedono la conversazione del lead: per questo il lead scrive brief completi e il contesto stabile sta in <span class="inline-code">CLAUDE.md</span>.</p>','<h4>No shared memory</h4><p>Teammates don\'t see the lead\'s conversation: that\'s why the lead writes complete briefs and stable context lives in <span class="inline-code">CLAUDE.md</span>.</p>'),
('<h4>Niente team nei team</h4><p>I teammate non possono creare altri teammate. La gerarchia è piatta: un lead, N specialisti.</p>','<h4>No teams within teams</h4><p>Teammates can\'t create other teammates. The hierarchy is flat: one lead, N specialists.</p>'),
('<h4>Subagent con nome</h4><p>Mentre gli agent teams sono attivi, i subagent a cui Claude dà un nome partono come teammate. Per tornare ai subagent in un progetto: variabile a <span class="inline-code">"0"</span> in <span class="inline-code">.claude/settings.local.json</span>.</p>','<h4>Named subagents</h4><p>While agent teams are on, subagents that Claude gives a name start as teammates. To get plain subagents back in a project: set the variable to <span class="inline-code">"0"</span> in <span class="inline-code">.claude/settings.local.json</span>.</p>'),
