("s:'una volta per macchina', f:'1×', d:'<b>Prepara la macchina.</b> Controlla i prerequisiti, abilita gli agent teams in <code class=\"inline-code\">~/.claude/settings.json</code>, ti fa scegliere il display mode (in-process o pannelli tmux) e propone un allow-list conservativo di comandi read-only. Ogni modifica ti viene mostrata come diff.'",
 "s:'once per machine', f:'1×', d:'<b>Prepares the machine.</b> Checks prerequisites, enables agent teams in <code class=\"inline-code\">~/.claude/settings.json</code>, lets you choose the display mode (in-process or tmux panes) and proposes a conservative allow-list of read-only commands. Every change is shown to you as a diff.'"),
