("s:'una volta per progetto', f:'1×', d:'<b>Insegna il repo al team.</b> Analizza in sola lettura manifest, workspace, script esistenti, convenzioni e aree sensibili. Propone la sezione <code class=\"inline-code\">## DevTeam</code> per <code class=\"inline-code\">CLAUDE.md</code> e i <code class=\"inline-code\">checks</code> del gate; dopo il tuo ok li scrive e verifica che ogni check passi.'",
 "s:'once per project', f:'1×', d:'<b>Teaches the repo to the team.</b> Read-only analysis of manifests, workspaces, existing scripts, conventions and sensitive areas. Proposes the <code class=\"inline-code\">## DevTeam</code> section for <code class=\"inline-code\">CLAUDE.md</code> and the gate <code class=\"inline-code\">checks</code>; after your ok it writes them and verifies every check passes.'"),
